    "evidence_text": "List of Danish Nobel laureates\n\nNobel Prize in Physics\n\nList of Nobel laureates in Physiology or Medicine\n\nHu Shih\n\n Hu is widely recognized today as a key contributor to Chinese liberalism and language reform in his advocacy for the use of written vernacular Chinese.\n\n He was also an influential redology scholar and held the famous Jiaxu manuscript () for many years until his death.\n\nNobel Prize in Literature\n\n The Swedish Academy decides who, if anyone, will receive the prize in any given year.\n\n The academy announces the name of the chosen laureate in early October.\n\nDerek Walcott\n\n He received the 1992 Nobel Prize in Literature.\n\n He was Professor of Poetry at the University of Essex from 2010 to 2013.\n\nMaxim Gorky\n\n He was also a five-time nominee for the Nobel Prize in Literature.\n\nHu Lanqi\n\nHu Lanqi (; 1901 \u2013 13 December 1994) was a Chinese writer and military leader.\n\nList of Nobel laureates in Literature\n\n The first Nobel Prize in Literature was awarded in 1901 to Sully Prudhomme of France.\n\nList of female Nobel laureates",
